+\[
+ H=\begin{pmatrix}L_{\eta\eta}&R_\eta^\dagger\\R_\eta&0\end{pmatrix},
+ \quad h=\binom{L_{\eta s}}{R_s},\qquad
+ z=L_{ss}-h^\dagger\operatorname{solve}(H,h).
+\]
